      {
        "id": "lem-cm-skew-matrix-cross-product-correspondence",
        "kind": "lemma",
        "domain": "mathematics",
        "title": "The skew-matrix/cross-product correspondence $[\\omega]_\\times z=\\omega\\times z$ and its conjugation law $R[\\omega]_\\times R^{\\mathsf T}=[R\\omega]_\\times$",
        "statement": "With [omega]_x the displayed skew matrix: [omega]_x z = omega x z; [omega]_x is skew and omega -> [omega]_x is a linear bijection onto the skew matrices with inverse Omega -> (Omega_32, Omega_13, Omega_21); and R[omega]_x R^T = [R omega]_x for every R in SO(3).",
